Domain Entity StudentInterventionAttendanceEvent
    documentation 'This event entity represents the recording of whether a student is in attendance 
                  'for an intervention service.
    include AttendanceEvent
        documentation 'Details of the AttendanceEvent.
        is required
    reference Student
        documentation 'Relates the Student associated with the AttendanceEvent.
        is part of identity
    reference Intervention
        documentation 'Relates the Intervention associated with the AttendanceEvent.
        is part of identity